    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI Ministry Process\n\n**Purpose:**\nHandles ministry-team events on a ministry request: ministry assignment and ministry task completion.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow called by FOI Request Routing for the `ministry` category (`foi-ministry-assignment`, `foi-ministry-complete`).\n\n**Processing:**\nReads the event payload into standard fields (IDs, status, assigned group and person, ministry group, file number). `Ministry Event Switch` then routes:\n- assignment → audit \"Ministry assignment\"\n- complete → audit \"Ministry task completed\"\n- other → end, no action\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nAudit only in the current wiring. Writes a `foi-process-audit` row (process_type = ministry-request-process). No API calls.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "da3c206d-8e58-4294-936a-1fef20b92d49",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -576,
        -864
      ]
    }
